# Markdown GFM Rule

Apply this rule for Markdown documentation changes.

## Requirements

- Use valid GitHub Flavored Markdown syntax.
- Keep heading hierarchy consistent.
- Prefer fenced code blocks with language tags when applicable.
- Keep lists and tables readable and consistent.
- Use links and references that resolve correctly in-repo.

## Avoid

- Raw HTML unless strictly necessary.
- Inconsistent heading levels or broken list structure.
